  "interpretation": "Exact for the declared frozen ranker and the rectangular budget of at most one selected provenance-group withdrawal plus at most one residual BINDS record deletion. A group removes the union of all records carrying its imported annotation; a residual record must survive that withdrawal. All competing compounds change jointly. Group and record budgets are separate units, not equal amounts of evidence. Source labels are not independent suppliers, and a citation need not identify one experiment. This is an evidence-quarantine sensitivity analysis, not a factual retraction, clinical effect, error probability or new biological discovery. Exactness is relative to decimal80-binary64-v1. Unselected annotations, other relation families, larger budgets, new records and model refitting are outside scope.",
